{
  "source": "Prompts/document-trap-3.mp4",
  "duration": 202.5244375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.96,
      "text": "Your season-end basketball tournament starts next week,"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.4,
      "end": 5.38,
      "text": "and you want to brush up on the rules before you play."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.0,
      "end": 8.9,
      "text": "You grab your league's massive 200-page rulebook"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.9,
      "end": 12.34,
      "text": "and upload the entire file into your AI assistant."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.18,
      "end": 14.9,
      "text": "Then you ask a straightforward question."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.62,
      "end": 17.44,
      "text": "How many fouls until I'm out of the game?"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.32,
      "end": 20.92,
      "text": "Almost instantly, the AI confidently answers"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.92,
      "end": 23.08,
      "text": "five fouls and you foul out."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.58,
      "end": 25.72,
      "text": "That doesn't sound quite right."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.4,
      "end": 28.68,
      "text": "You clearly remember a player in last year's tournament"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.68,
      "end": 31.1,
      "text": "picking up five fouls and staying on the court."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.12,
      "end": 33.06,
      "text": "To figure out the discrepancy,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.76,
      "end": 35.2,
      "text": "you open up the massive document"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.2,
      "end": 37.02,
      "text": "and dig through all the rules yourself."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.92,
      "end": 41.34,
      "text": "You find that the regular season limit is exactly five fouls."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.88,
      "end": 43.26,
      "text": "The AI pulled accurate text."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.16,
      "end": 45.66,
      "text": "But near the very end of the text,"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.06,
      "end": 47.78,
      "text": "there's a special section for tournament games."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.6,
      "end": 52.18,
      "text": "In those specific matchups, players get six fouls."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.74,
      "end": 54.54,
      "text": "The AI retrieved the standard limit"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.54,
      "end": 56.16,
      "text": "and completely missed the exception."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.9,
      "end": 58.6,
      "text": "The response wasn't a hallucination."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.3,
      "end": 62.08,
      "text": "The AI simply delivered a dangerously incomplete answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.08,
      "end": 63.74,
      "text": "based on a partial search of the text."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.6,
      "end": 65.56,
      "text": "When we attach a file,"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.84,
      "end": 67.56,
      "text": "we naturally assume the AI reads"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.56,
      "end": 69.48,
      "text": "and internalizes the entire text."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.1,
      "end": 71.72,
      "text": "A short file might fit perfectly"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.72,
      "end": 73.78,
      "text": "into an AI's active processing space,"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.14,
      "end": 75.36,
      "text": "known as its context window."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.98,
      "end": 77.04,
      "text": "But with a long file,"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.54,
      "end": 79.5,
      "text": "a retrieval machine searches the document,"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.96,
      "end": 81.86,
      "text": "hunting for passages that match your keywords."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.52,
      "end": 84.76,
      "text": "Here, the six foul tournament exception"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.76,
      "end": 88.08,
      "text": "was physically left behind in the unselected pages."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.94,
      "end": 90.62,
      "text": "The AI only generates answers"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.62,
      "end": 93.84,
      "text": "using the specific paragraphs its search mechanism hands over."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.34,
      "end": 96.5,
      "text": "Its final response is strictly limited"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.5,
      "end": 98.38,
      "text": "by what that search uncovers."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.08,
      "end": 100.8,
      "text": "The breakdown started with the prompt itself."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.48,
      "end": 102.78,
      "text": "The user left the word tournament"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.78,
      "end": 104.18,
      "text": "out of their original question."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.06,
      "end": 107.34,
      "text": "To force the system to check for special conditions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.98,
      "end": 109.6,
      "text": "you have to provide exact instructions."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.44,
      "end": 111.9,
      "text": "We can rewrite the prompt like this."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.28,
      "end": 114.68,
      "text": "In tournament games, how many files are allowed?"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.3,
      "end": 116.72,
      "text": "Quote the rule and any exceptions."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.56,
      "end": 119.42,
      "text": "Guided by those specific new parameters,"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.0,
      "end": 122.42,
      "text": "the AI successfully retrieves the special section"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.42,
      "end": 124.28,
      "text": "and confirms the six foul rule."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.9,
      "end": 127.3,
      "text": "Because the system relies on keyword retrieval,"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.9,
      "end": 129.16,
      "text": "the completeness of your answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.16,
      "end": 131.94,
      "text": "depends directly on the precision of your question."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.74,
      "end": 134.88,
      "text": "Navigating massive text files safely"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.88,
      "end": 136.52,
      "text": "requires a systematic approach."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.12,
      "end": 139.72,
      "text": "This infographic outlines four tips for long documents."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.5,
      "end": 143.2,
      "text": "First, name the section with headings and keywords."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.98,
      "end": 147.06,
      "text": "Second, ask one thing, giving the system a clear target."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.84,
      "end": 151.24,
      "text": "Third, share what matters by pasting the exact passage."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.96,
      "end": 155.28,
      "text": "Fourth, ask for the quote so you can manually compare it"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.28,
      "end": 155.68,
      "text": "with the original."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.46,
      "end": 159.28,
      "text": "These four tactics make the correct passages easier to find."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.94,
      "end": 161.66,
      "text": "They are risk mitigation tools"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.66,
      "end": 164.7,
      "text": "rather than a guarantee that you've received the whole story."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.48,
      "end": 167.44,
      "text": "You will encounter this same search limitation"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.44,
      "end": 169.48,
      "text": "in high stakes adult paperwork."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.54,
      "end": 173.08,
      "text": "We regularly use AI to summarize apartment leases,"
    },
    {
      "start": 173.58,
      "end": 175.48,
      "text": "employment contracts, insurance policies,"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.98,
      "end": 176.9,
      "text": "and financial aid letters."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.74,
      "end": 180.46,
      "text": "Those dense legal documents are built entirely"
    },
    {
      "start": 180.46,
      "end": 182.64,
      "text": "on buried conditions and exceptions"
    },
    {
      "start": 182.64,
      "end": 184.24,
      "text": "that alter the standard terms."
    },
    {
      "start": 185.08,
      "end": 186.68,
      "text": "Transferring a file to an AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 186.68,
      "end": 189.18,
      "text": "is not the equivalent of human comprehension."
    },
    {
      "start": 190.36,
      "end": 192.5,
      "text": "Uploaded doesn't mean fully read."
    },
    {
      "start": 193.32,
      "end": 194.7,
      "text": "To survive the document trap,"
    },
    {
      "start": 194.7,
      "end": 198.74,
      "text": "explicitly command the AI to find the rule and any exceptions."
    }
  ],
